 994  86A8              ; VGA text-mode test: 80x25, character plane 0, attribute plane 1.
 995  86A8              ; Uses the adapter's bank-6 text aperture (C000h-C7CFh).
 996  86A8              ; Scrolls rows 1..24 to rows 0..23, clears row 24, then verifies
 997  86A8              ; character and attribute readback through the VGA plane read map.
 998  86A8              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
