1004  86B1                      ; The preceding 256-colour gradient test leaves a custom DAC ramp.
1005  86B1                      ; Restore the standard 16-colour VGA palette before testing text
1006  86B1                      ; attributes, which are expected to use the conventional EGA colours.
1007  86B1 CD 32 86             CALL    ProgramStandardEgaPalette
1008  86B4
1009  86B4                      ; Program the VGA CRTC for a real 80-column, 25-row mode 3
1010  86B4                      ; timing (720x400, 9-dot characters, 16 scanlines per row).
1011  86B4                      ; The adapter must derive text geometry from these registers;
1012  86B4                      ; the renderer must not invent a default column count.
